    "Premises.leaf_sound": "conditional in-circuit leaf verifier soundness under the fixed leaf key: a carrier pre-state opening to pre_d runs steps steps to a carrier post-state (SAS O2, SVM-002, SRC-005 test obligation); Carrier enters at genesis and propagates (S5)",
